<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Griffin managing director Meehan resigns.</title>
<headline>Griffin managing director Meehan resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Griffin Shipping Holdings Ltd announced on Tuesday that managing director Mike Meehan would resign with effect from July 31, 1997, to pursue his own interests.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Meehan's resignation had been received with regret and his departure was on amicable terms.</p>
<p>Management of Griffin would in future fall directly under parent company Grindrod Unicorn Group Ltd, it added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
